## Key Changes

1. **[brain_v1.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/brain_v1.ts)**: Every agent request flows through `Oracle Strategy → Local Inference → Truth Anchor` — no external API calls
2. **[llm.ts](file:///c:/Users/ferna/Downloads/appforge-main/swarm/core/llm.ts)**: Gemini import replaced with Iron Brain. Antigravity fallback removed. Compression uses local truncation
3. **DPO Training**: Model learns to prefer sovereign solutions over cloud-dependent ones (e.g., wallet auth > Firebase, local model > SageMaker)
4. **Decision-Action Chains**: Full reasoning traces: Context → Strategy → Quantum Simulation (3 branches evaluated) → Execution → Validation

## Activation Steps

```bash
# 1. Setup environment
conda env create -f swarm/factory/environment.yml
conda activate appforge-train

# 2. Train (SFT + DPO)
python swarm/factory/train.py

# 3. Launch Iron Brain
scripts\launchers\launch_iron_brain.bat
```
